---
import Hero_image from "../assets/HeroImage.avif";
---

<section class="section">
  <div
    class="container-x flex flex-col md:flex-row items-center justify-center"
  >
    <div class="flex flex-col items-start w-full text-left p-10 justify-center">
      <h1 class="text-blue-500">About Me</h1>
      <h3>Details</h3>
      <p>
        <ul>
          <li>Name: J.T.</li>
          <li>Age: 22</li>
          <li>Nationality: Thai - American (Dual-Citizen)</li>
        </ul>
      </p>
      <h3>Education</h3>
      <p>Bachelor in Information Technology from Bangkok University</p>
      <h3>Experience</h3>
      <p>
        Video Content Creator (2023 – Present), Open house volunteer (2023 –
        2024), Robotics teacher’s assistant & volunteering (2019 – 2023)
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="flex flex-col items-start w-full text-left p-10 justify-center">
      <h3 class="text-center md:text-left">Description</h3>
      <p class="subtitle">
        Hi, I'm an IT Administrator and Teacher at St. Marks Australian
        International School and a student at Bangkok University, but I've
        always been a maker first. I'm drawn to the space where technical logic
        meets visual storytelling, focusing not just on how a system works, but
        on how it is experienced. I find the most satisfaction in taking
        something clunky or outdated and rebuilding it into something seamless
        and modern. From hands-on hardware work like building my own computer to
        the fine details of video editing, my focus is always on the transition
        from "functional" to "intentional." While I value the stability of a
        well-run system, I'm most at home when I'm refining and evolving tools
        to ensure they actually make sense for the people who use them.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
